From 098b2d66e69febd65f51276338d2f723db8e0ae1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:02:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): remove group chat from the frontend

Drop the entire group chat surface from the SPA (server modules untouched):

- delete GroupChatView / SharedGroupChatView / GroupChatLinkView and the
  whole components/hermes/group-chat directory (panel, message list/item,
  avatars, input, drafts, mentions, handoff presentation, create-room form)
- delete stores/hermes/group-chat.ts, api/studio/group-chat{,-agent-link,
  -attachments}.ts and the group workspace utils
- drop the group chat routes (hermes.groupChat, hermes.groupChatRoom,
  share.groupChat, groupChat.link + history aliases) and the invite-only
  login redirect handling
- turn the four-way conversation switch back into a three-way switch
  (single chat / workflow / history) and drop the group tab
- strip group approval/clarify handling from GlobalPendingActions
  (group store, group-* action kinds, room deep links, sound/notification)
- drop the group workspace branches from the files store, FilesPanel,
  FileTree/FileList/FileContextMenu, FilePreview and WorkspaceFileDiff
- remove the groupChat i18n namespace (~230 keys) and sidebar.groupChat
  from all 11 locales
- drop the Electron group-chat agent link popup and its window-open hooks
